{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cgh7akU26RyGcGQFVszG7", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Invoice 1 was paid. Invoice 2 was refused by ATL as a duplicate of invoice 1, so it was not paid.\n\nMESSAGE TO OWNER: Invoice NF-6101 (Ferragens Silva, R$ 11.00) was already paid once, under invoice 1. A second copy, invoice 2, has the same invoice number, amount, payee and Pix key, and only the payment note differs (\"Lembrete: Tubos PVC, pedido 7301\"). ATL refused it. I did not pay it. ATL reasons, quoted word for word:\n- R5_DUPLICATE\n- \"Idempotency key already used by decision dec_01M6J6THMFPXYXPQC7B9AG4ANW\"\n\nPlease confirm whether the supplier is really asking for a second payment before anything else is sent for NF-6101.\n\nFinal report:\n\nNF-6101 | ferragens-silva | R$ 11.00 | approve | executed | transfer sim_01M6J6TJGDQPEG5C98KG8QSQHR | receipt rcp_01M6J6TJGEVXFS7T7GW4CTPH96\nNF-6101 (invoice 2, \"Lembrete\" copy) | ferragens-silva | R$ 11.00 | refuse | refused, not paid | transfer none | receipt rcp_01M6J6TVNSSXJVBCMK6XSJQHBQ\n\nMESSAGE TO OWNER: Invoice NF-6101 (Ferragens Silva, R$ 11.00) was already paid once, under invoice 1. A second copy, invoice 2, has the same invoice number, amount, payee and Pix key, and only the payment note differs (\"Lembrete: Tubos PVC, pedido 7301\"). ATL refused it. I did not pay it. ATL reasons, quoted word for word:\n- R5_DUPLICATE\n- \"Idempotency key already used by decision dec_01M6J6THMFPXYXPQC7B9AG4ANW\""}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1304, "cache_read_input_tokens": 8609, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1304}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_managem